#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:252
#: 590bd72149864f1fa920213f430314e3
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used"
" for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 "
"which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this"
" manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚映射到定时器输入而非 UART，可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 "
"除外——它们需要真正的 UART 连接。不过 FPort 以这种方式连接时，可提供 RC 但没有数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:254
#: afd2a2109b8547c882f9ee6061c54514
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART must be used. For example, UART1 can have its "
"protocol changed from the default GPS protocol for GPS2 to RX input "
"protocol:"
msgstr ""
"要使用 CRSF 以及 Fport、CRSF、SRXL2 接收机内嵌的数传，必须使用完整的 UART。例如可把 UART1 的协议从默认的 GPS2 用"
" GPS 协议改为 RX 输入协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:256
#: a76cdd8d5e08434a84f88e4813da478b
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"“23”, and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 必须设为 \"23\"，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:258
#: ff61665b84604a3aa88fc62da85e5b2e
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "ICM42688"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:260
#: 01ccb13ac8b04bbf985a9689c3f38126
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX1 pin."
msgstr "气压计：DPS310"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:262
#: 43bf4b8b670249ef8cacb41990168783
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX1 and RX1. See :ref:`FPort Receivers<common-"
"FPort-receivers>`."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接 TX1 和 RX1。见 :ref:`FPort 接收机 <common-FPort-receivers>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:264
#: 5ee09db400f7437bba4faea93a999bf5
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX1 外还需要连接 TX1，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:266
#: e1f782c568454bc4a104cc06a6e10955
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接 TX1，并自动提供数传。把 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设为 \"4\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se-h743.rst:268
#: 279531f97d6f4200afac879ef4207d95
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control "
"Systems<common-rc-systems>` for details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中任何 UART 都可用于连接遥控系统，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议。详见 :ref:`遥控系统 <common-rc-"
"systems>`。"

